      ]
    }
  },
  "icons_library": "lucide-react",
  "animations": {
    "hover": "transition-all duration-300 ease-out",
    "card_hover": "hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-purple-500/20",
    "framer_motion_variants": {
      "hidden": { "opacity": 0, "y": 20 },
      "visible": { "opacity": 1, "y": 0, "transition": { "duration": 0.5 } }
    }
  },
  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Use Tailwind CSS for all styling. Ensure dark mode is strictly enforced globally (bg-slate-950).",
    "Add 'data-testid' to ALL interactive elements, forms, and cards.",
    "Implement glassmorphism for header, cards, and dropdowns (bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10).",
    "Do not use transparent headers. Use glassmorphism for sticky header.",
    "Use Framer Motion for page transitions and staggering lists.",
    "For icons, use lucide-react. For 3D or advanced charts, use Recharts for Admin dashboard.",
    "Avoid Shadcn 'Card' component if it restricts creative glassmorphism, instead build custom HTML/Tailwind cards using the styles provided in this JSON.",
    "Ensure the layout feels spacious and premium. Maintain contrast for text.",
    "Adhere to .js files, no TypeScript."
  ]
}